Package: libgoffice-0.10-10
Version: @DEB_GOFFICE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/goffice
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libgsf-1-114, libxml2, libxslt1.1, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0
Description: GOffice spreadsheet/chart library
 GOffice provides document, charting, and plugin support used by Gnumeric. This
 iOS build keeps GTK3 support and omits optional SVG, equation, EPS, and
 introspection features.
